mp4?t=1751516370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming:</strong> Cultivate various crops in planting boxes and use water and power systems to create automated irrigation setups, ensuring a stable food supply for long-term survival and making your shelter truly self-sufficient.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/5b6cf5ba8530bd95d1ac05202ec395f7.poster.avif?t=1751516370\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/5b6cf5ba8530bd95d1ac05202ec395f7.webm?t=1751516370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/5b6cf5ba8530bd95d1ac05202ec395f7.mp4?t=1751516370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Game Modes:</strong> Go solo and explore at your own pace, or team up with friends for co-op survival fun. Jump into the training grounds to test weapons, unleash your creativity in the build sandbox, or take on light survival challenges in survival mode. More fun modes coming soon!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The Apocalypse is a low-poly sandbox survival shooter set in a post-apocalyptic world. Scavenge, craft, build, and fight against zombies and mutants. Enjoy fast-paced gunplay and light survival in a fun, open-world adventure with multiple game modes!",
